  "description": "A large man in the dark sky. A demon. Something in the shape of a bat. He was feared and worshipped by everyone for a long time, but now no one remembers him. He has been forgotten. But he still exists and watches over us. Today, twenty years after Baekjungnal, the long-awaited sacrifice of \"him\" is finally offered.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of the 2024 Post Type Fall Anthology (\\[BL\\] 2024 포스타입 앤솔로지 | 가을).*",
